#%PAM-1.0
# Hocuspanda's lock screen (docs/design/lock.md): the password checked as
# the system's login checks it, with its own modules. The compositor runs
# as the user, not root: pam_unix checks through its helper, and no
# module that keeps a tally as root (pam_faillock) can count here.
@include common-auth
@include common-account
